  "bodyHash": "H9yJCrD+EwI=",
  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Z2BN6Y6/banner.png\" alt=\"模組橫幅 - 原神樂器\" width=\"768\" height=\"283\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>將《原神》的一系列樂器加入你的 Minecraft 體驗中，並使用熟悉的按鍵綁定來演奏你最喜愛的歌曲！<br>尋找<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/even-more-instruments\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多樂器</a>？👀<br>（剛開始演奏？查看<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fblog%252fhow-to-master-the-lyre-genshin-instruments-mod%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">這個簡明教學</a>）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_m7oIwfqpPI?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>完整 MIDI 支援！</strong></h2><p><em><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WaCIP4lWEzk?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></em></p><p><em><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7PKk7qorFTk?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></em></p><p><em><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IMJbt353j9o?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></em></p><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">此模組為遊戲添加以下樂器：</span></h2><ul>\n<li><strong>風物之詩琴</strong> [立體聲支援]</li>\n<li><strong>薔薇花琴</strong> [舊版與新版]</li>\n<li><strong>古舊的詩琴</strong> [標準化支援]<strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong>荒瀧·盛世豪鼓</strong></li>\n<li><strong>夜風之聲號角</strong> [可持續音效]</li>\n<li><strong>烏克麗麗</strong> [和弦轉高音支援]</li>\n<li><strong>咚咚鼓</strong></li>\n</ul><p>樂器紋理由才華洋溢的 Gen 製作！快去看看他們的作品，並表達你的支持 😋</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fGenMode\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fgen%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">PlanetMinecraft</a> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/GenMedia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> | <a href=\"https://twitter.com/DatapackGen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter</a></p><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><br>支援功能：</span></p><ul>\n<li>每種樂器可自訂音高，以半音為單位遞增</li>\n<li>可透過左 Shift 與 Alt 鍵調整移調（依你的按鍵綁定設定）</li>\n<li>多套音符標籤（鍵盤標籤符合你的語言與佈局、音樂記譜法等！）</li>\n<li>多人遊戲與共享樂器畫面！</li>\n<li>完整 MIDI 支援！</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>⚠️ 重要事項 ⚠️：模組作者已終止此專案</strong></h2><p>觀看以下影片以了解更多：</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TUzdklT4vcs?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>內容聚焦</strong></h2><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1CVVqa2BHVE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bCLnB21RSj4?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lzwnBKp6Pg0?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Gvs3MRvkJR4?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>（以上影片透過 <a href=\"https://github.com/k5md/M2KB\" rel=\"nofollow\">M2KB</a> 專案實現）</p><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>你是內容創作者嗎？或是詩琴演奏者？</strong></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\">透過<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/private-messages/send?recipient=stavwasplays\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge 私訊</a>聯繫我，讓你的影片<strong>在此</strong>展示！</p><hr><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></h2><p><strong>風物之詩琴<br></strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fMDz9ul.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p><p><strong>古舊的詩琴</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Dtbc6lk.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p><p><strong>薔薇花琴</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cMR8lkA.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p><p><strong>荒瀧·盛世豪鼓</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/165Cjnf.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p><p><strong>夜風之聲號角<br></strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bY07PUc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>本專案與 HoYoverse 及《原神》皆無關聯。</p><p>所有音訊資源與設計元素皆屬該公司所有。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><br>這個最初僅為小型學習測試的專案，如今已成為我首次公開發表的創作。身為一位普通的 Minecraft 與原神愛好者，能夠與社群分享這份成果，我感到無比興奮與喜悅 :^)</p>",
